/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The Coaching Assistant Platform is a transformative AI-driven tool that enhances team management and coaching strategies by providing real-time insights and personalized recommendations. Traditional coaching methods often rely on manual tracking and intuition, which can be time-consuming and prone to errors. This project demonstrates how artificial intelligence can bridge this gap by offering data-driven suggestions for training, nutrition, and match tactics, tailored to the specific needs of a team and its players.)
/E (The Coaching Assistant Platform is a transformative AI-driven tool that enhances team management and coaching strategies by providing real-time insights and personalized recommendations. Traditional coaching methods often rely on manual tracking and intuition, which can be time-consuming and prone to errors. This project demonstrates how artificial intelligence can bridge this gap by offering data-driven suggestions for training, nutrition, and match tactics, tailored to the specific needs of a team and its players.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
450 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (By integrating advanced AI models like Gemma 2-2B, the platform provides coaches with smart, actionable recommendations that enhance decision-making and optimize team performance. Whether it's developing personalized training plans, suggesting dietary strategies, or offering tactical advice, the system ensures that coaches have a comprehensive toolset to improve their teams' results. The use of a user-friendly web interface allows easy access to these insights, helping coaches at all levels to make informed choices)
/E (By integrating advanced AI models like Gemma 2-2B, the platform provides coaches with smart, actionable recommendations that enhance decision-making and optimize team performance. Whether it's developing personalized training plans, suggesting dietary strategies, or offering tactical advice, the system ensures that coaches have a comprehensive toolset to improve their teams' results. The use of a user-friendly web interface allows easy access to these insights, helping coaches at all levels to make informed choices)
/Pg 24 0 R
